biome (0.2.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Port to Fedora 45 and wlroots 0.20.
  * Fix a crash when a layer-shell popup was created (xdg_popup
    unconstraining now deferred to the initial commit).
  * Force DRM Broadcast RGB to Full; per-output rgb_range override in
    Biome.conf.

 -- Nicholas Yoder <nicholasyoder@proton.me>  Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:00:00 -0500

biome (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Protocols: xdg-activation-v1 (launchers can raise existing windows;
    unhonored requests mark the window urgent), wlr-data-control (clipboard
    managers), pointer-constraints and relative-pointer (games, 3D apps),
    pointer-gestures (trackpad swipe/pinch/hold), wlr-gamma-control (night
    light tools such as wlsunset), single-pixel-buffer, xdg-shell v6.
  * Decorations: load themes from external layered QSS (as shipped by
    Forest themes) with live reload on config change, and render at the
    output's scale so they stay sharp at fractional scales.
  * GlobalShortcuts: send Deactivated on the key's release so clients can
    tell a hold from a tap; idempotent BindShortcuts, readable trigger
    descriptions, and collisions with existing bindings rejected.
  * Enforce layer-shell keyboard_interactivity per spec, and focus popups
    on map only when grabbing or activated through xdg-activation.
  * Outputs: persist the last output-management apply to Biome.conf; keep
    reconnected outputs off until the next wake; close layer surfaces when
    their output is disabled.
  * Exit when the -s command exits, so Biome can host a greetd greeter.
  * Limit the Alt-Tab switcher to the active workspace.
  * Drop a fullscreen window below a newly focused window on its output.
  * Fix maximized/fullscreen windows flashing unmaximized on map.
  * Fix a crash when an Xwayland window toggles override-redirect, keep
    Xwayland popups above fullscreen windows, and leave splash screens
    undecorated and centered.
  * Fix layer-shell fade-ins jumping partway on large outputs.

 -- Nicholas Yoder <nicholasyoder@proton.me>  Mon, 09 Nov 2026 12:00:00 -0500

biome (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release: a fixed-policy floating Wayland compositor on wlroots 0.18,
    built as the compositor for the Forest desktop.
  * Window management: floating placement, maximize/fullscreen, Qt/QSS-themed
    server-side decorations, Alt-Tab switcher with previews, workspaces
    (ext-workspace-v1), window open/close fades.
  * Xwayland support.
  * Shell protocols: wlr-layer-shell, wlr-foreign-toplevel-management,
    ext-session-lock-v1, ext-idle-notify-v1, idle-inhibit,
    wlr-output-power-management, wlr-screencopy, cursor-shape-v1.
  * Outputs: wlr-output-management for live layout changes, hotplug
    handling, fractional scaling, layout persisted in
    ~/.config/Biome/Biome.conf with system drop-ins in /etc/biome/conf.d.
  * Global shortcuts via an org.freedesktop.impl.portal.GlobalShortcuts
    backend.
  * Logs at info level by default; set BIOME_DEBUG=1 for debug logging.

 -- Nicholas Yoder <nicholasyoder@proton.me>  Mon, 05 Oct 2026 12:00:00 -0400
